{"cast":"moss","group":"game","bank":"game.b154f09976.bin","lines":[{"id":"game.intro.ones.01","moment":"game.intro.ones","text":"Ones under the canopy! First to eleven, make it take it. Just you, the hoop, and one defender.","off":0,"len":24410,"sec":4.806},{"id":"game.intro.ones.02","moment":"game.intro.ones","text":"Alright, one-on-one in the woods! First to eleven, make it take it. Roots down, friends.","off":24410,"len":24436,"sec":4.695},{"id":"game.intro.threes.01","moment":"game.intro.threes","text":"Threes at Canopy Court! Three on three, first to twenty-one, ninety seconds on the clock. Let's go!","off":48846,"len":27142,"sec":5.389},{"id":"game.intro.threes.02","moment":"game.intro.threes","text":"Two groves, three trees each! First to twenty-one, ninety-second clock. Share the sunlight out there.","off":75988,"len":27412,"sec":5.414},{"id":"game.check.01","moment":"game.check","text":"Stand tall, friend. Their ball.","off":103400,"len":11329,"sec":1.508},{"id":"game.check.02","moment":"game.check","text":"Check it up. Roots down.","off":114729,"len":10132,"sec":1.296},{"id":"game.check.03","moment":"game.check","text":"Defense now. Be the tree.","off":124861,"len":10514,"sec":1.357},{"id":"game.check.04","moment":"game.check","text":"Ball's theirs. Guard the clearing.","off":135375,"len":11252,"sec":1.526},{"id":"game.make.01","moment":"game.make","text":"Easy breeze.","off":146627,"len":8042,"sec":0.867},{"id":"game.make.02","moment":"game.make","text":"Soft touch.","off":154669,"len":7845,"sec":0.814},{"id":"game.make.03","moment":"game.make","text":"Drops right in.","off":162514,"len":8682,"sec":0.959},{"id":"game.make.04","moment":"game.make","text":"Clean jumper.","off":171196,"len":8299,"sec":0.903},{"id":"game.make.05","moment":"game.make","text":"Pure as creek water.","off":179495,"len":9246,"sec":1.153},{"id":"game.make.06","moment":"game.make","text":"Nice, count it.","off":188741,"len":8765,"sec":0.964},{"id":"game.three.01","moment":"game.three","text":"From deep in the woods!","off":197506,"len":9329,"sec":1.113},{"id":"game.three.02","moment":"game.three","text":"Treeline shot, drops in!","off":206835,"len":10481,"sec":1.395},{"id":"game.three.03","moment":"game.three","text":"Ooh, long range!","off":217316,"len":8189,"sec":0.901},{"id":"game.three.04","moment":"game.three","text":"Way back there, yes!","off":225505,"len":9186,"sec":1.113},{"id":"game.three.05","moment":"game.three","text":"Ha! Rained that one in!","off":234691,"len":9572,"sec":1.145},{"id":"game.layup.01","moment":"game.layup","text":"Soft as moss.","off":244263,"len":8390,"sec":0.918},{"id":"game.layup.02","moment":"game.layup","text":"Like a leaf landing.","off":252653,"len":9198,"sec":1.07},{"id":"game.layup.03","moment":"game.layup","text":"Ooh, finesse at the rim!","off":261851,"len":9354,"sec":1.102},{"id":"game.layup.04","moment":"game.layup","text":"Right up the trunk!","off":271205,"len":8862,"sec":0.964},{"id":"game.dunk.01","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Rim's still swaying!","off":280067,"len":9127,"sec":1.051},{"id":"game.dunk.02","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Branches shaking!","off":289194,"len":8886,"sec":1.055},{"id":"game.dunk.03","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Whoa, from the treetops!","off":298080,"len":9997,"sec":1.216},{"id":"game.dunk.04","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Ha! Right through the leaves!","off":308077,"len":10036,"sec":1.246},{"id":"game.dunk.05","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Big one, friends!","off":318113,"len":8564,"sec":0.974},{"id":"game.poster.01","moment":"game.poster","text":"Timber! Oh, timber!","off":326677,"len":9136,"sec":1.072},{"id":"game.poster.02","moment":"game.poster","text":"The whole forest woke up!","off":335813,"len":10067,"sec":1.285},{"id":"game.poster.03","moment":"game.poster","text":"Posterized! Hang it in the treehouse!","off":345880,"len":12647,"sec":1.826},{"id":"game.poster.04","moment":"game.poster","text":"Whoa! Sailed right over!","off":358527,"len":9429,"sec":1.096},{"id":"