k?","off":1050529,"len":13754,"sec":2.125},{"id":"game.loss.02","moment":"game.loss","text":"They took this one. Good roots, though. Come again.","off":1064283,"len":14225,"sec":2.217},{"id":"game.loss.03","moment":"game.loss","text":"The other side had it. Rematch under the leaves?","off":1078508,"len":14252,"sec":2.211},{"id":"game.draw.01","moment":"game.draw","text":"Tied at the buzzer! Two groves, roots all tangled.","off":1092760,"len":15854,"sec":2.531},{"id":"game.draw.02","moment":"game.draw","text":"Even up! Two trees, same height!","off":1108614,"len":11498,"sec":1.598},{"id":"game.assist.01","moment":"game.assist","text":"Shared the sunlight!","off":1120112,"len":8759,"sec":0.982},{"id":"game.assist.02","moment":"game.assist","text":"Ooh, what a dish!","off":1128871,"len":8235,"sec":0.853},{"id":"game.assist.03","moment":"game.assist","text":"Carried on the breeze!","off":1137106,"len":9051,"sec":1.098},{"id":"game.assist.04","moment":"game.assist","text":"That's how forests grow!","off":1146157,"len":9992,"sec":1.208},{"id":"game.alleyoop.01","moment":"game.alleyoop","text":"Up to the high branch!","off":1156149,"len":9552,"sec":1.123},{"id":"game.alleyoop.02","moment":"game.alleyoop","text":"Caught it in the canopy!","off":1165701,"len":9379,"sec":1.125},{"id":"game.alleyoop.03","moment":"game.alleyoop","text":"Whoa! Picked from the sky!","off":1175080,"len":9699,"sec":1.183},{"id":"game.clock.01","moment":"game.clock","text":"Ten seconds left, friends!","off":1184779,"len":11008,"sec":1.421},{"id":"game.clock.02","moment":"game.clock","text":"Last light! Ten seconds!","off":1195787,"len":10543,"sec":1.356},{"id":"game.clock.03","moment":"game.clock","text":"Final ten, run like deer!","off":1206330,"len":10768,"sec":1.388},{"id":"game.overdrive.01","moment":"game.overdrive","text":"Full canopy! Overdrive!","off":1217098,"len":10478,"sec":1.418},{"id":"game.overdrive.02","moment":"game.overdrive","text":"Three trees, one root system!","off":1227576,"len":11434,"sec":1.501},{"id":"game.overdrive.03","moment":"game.overdrive","text":"Whoa, the canopy's glowing now!","off":1239010,"len":11761,"sec":1.543}]}